@kb.help.area.about_me ui.help.area word=about_me world=user.profile says="To get to know you and keep your profile, you can say, for example: \"I work as a designer\", \"Where do I live\" or \"My name is Andy Lee\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
@kb.help.area.animal ui.help.area word=animal world=games.guess says="To play guess the animal, you can say, for example: \"I don't know\", \"I am thinking of an animal\" or \"I was thinking of a giraffe\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
@kb.help.area.animal_game ui.help.area word=animal_game world=games.guess says="To play guess the animal, you can say, for example: \"I don't know\", \"I am thinking of an animal\" or \"I was thinking of a giraffe\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
@kb.help.area.animals ui.help.area word=animals world=kids.animals says="To talk about animals, you can say, for example: \"Does a dog have 4 legs\", \"A zebra has 4 legs\" or \"What does a rabbit eat\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
@kb.help.area.arith ui.help.area word=arith world=kids.arith says="To do sums, you can say, for example: \"Ana gave Tom an apple\", \"Does Tom have any apples\" or \"Ana gave an apple to Tom\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
@kb.help.area.atlas ui.help.area word=atlas world=geo.map says="To show places on a map, you can say, for example: \"Show latitude 48.8 longitude 2.3\", \"Is Paris the capital of France\" or \"Zoom all the way out\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
@kb.help.area.avatar ui.help.area word=avatar world=ui.avatar says="To change my face, you can say, for example: \"Try the next mouth\", \"What character is on screen\" or \"Make your body lighter\"." core.source="generated:scripts/gen-ui-kb.mjs:ui.help"
